# slice-2 sweep intermediates: the harness re-emits one rig per AOI as
# s2_{test,ref}_NN.in.  Only the two committed endpoints (aoi45 = the
# 45-deg anchor, aoi15 = the tightest fold) are evidence; the numbered
# intermediates are deterministic and regenerable.
s2_test_[0-9][0-9].in
s2_ref_[0-9][0-9].in
# engine stdout log
fort.6
# slice-3 emitted rigs + Reference-twins (regenerable from the harness)
s3_test.in
s3_ref.in
s3_test_twin.in
s3_ref_twin.in
